ました！！！\n万理華さんの演技が素敵で\n見惚れました。。。♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、ホラー映画なわけじゃなく\nストーリーが感動で\n不思議で、何度も見直したくなります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度も巻き戻ししてみました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わあ！！！って怖いところもあるけど\n静かに涙が出てきたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろなことを考えられました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な映画でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、ドラマばかりで\n映画を見てなかったけど\nやっぱり映画みるのたのしい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろなことを感じで思って\n刺激になります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は邦画の方が好きです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、のぎえいごでたくさん英会話や英語を学んで、いつか洋画を英語のままみてみたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！それから\nギターを弾けるようになりたいと思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アコースティックギター！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お父さんに教えてもらう約束しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/30/4986884/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/30/4986884/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  いしこーさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"t